 end="00:48.437">heal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.518" end="00:58.072"><span begin="00:51.518" end="00:53.431">You </span><span begin="00:53.431" end="00:54.541">look </span><span begin="00:54.541" end="00:54.794">so </span><span begin="00:54.794" end="00:58.068">tired-unhappy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.772" end="01:04.372"><span begin="00:57.772" end="00:59.785">Bring </span><span begin="00:59.785" end="01:01.046">down </span><span begin="01:01.046" end="01:01.450">the </span><span begin="01:01.450" end="01:04.364">government</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.074" end="01:15.772"><span begin="01:04.074" end="01:05.987">They </span><span begin="01:05.987" end="01:07.501">don't </span><span begin="01:07.501" end="01:08.005">they </span><span begin="01:08.005" end="01:08.560">don't </span><span begin="01:08.560" end="01:09.368">speak </span><span begin="01:09.368" end="01:10.530">for </span><span begin="01:10.530" end="01:15.767">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.884" end="01:26.111"><span begin="01:16.884" end="01:19.152">I'll </span><span begin="01:19.152" end="01:19.956">take </span><span begin="01:19.956" end="01:20.210">a </span><span begin="01:20.210" end="01:21.522">quiet </span><span begin="01:21.522" end="01:26.107">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.961" end="01:35.694"><span begin="01:25.961" end="01:27.068">A </span><span begin="01:27.068" end="01:28.026">handshake </span><span begin="01:28.026" end="01:28.430">of </span><span begin="01:28.430" end="01:28.835">carbon </span><span begin="01:28.835" end="01:35.690">monoxide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.394" end="01:38.769"><span begin="01:35.394" end="01:36.296">With </span><span begin="01:36.296" end="01:36.650">no </span><span begin="01:36.650" end="01:37.256">alarms </span><span begin="01:37.256" end="01:37.557">and </span><span begin="01:37.557" end="01:37.860">no </span><span begin="01:37.860" end="01:38.766">surprises</span></p><p ttm:a